      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AP intake | Deterministic approval and human review\nUpload / readonly Gmail \u2192 Archive & Read \u2192 Invoice Analysis Agent \u2192 Validate & Apply Approval Policy. Approved/rejected decisions return immediately; pending reviews notify the local reviewer. Technical checks, versions and audit records stay in Python.",
        "width": 2800,
        "height": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Current Scope",
      "id": "89b3c6e5-f6e0-4449-a77b-a92cb1fde6c2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        490
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Derived from APAgentIntakeV7; v7 is preserved\nOnly newly created review tasks enter automatic policy here. Existing pending tasks require explicit reevaluation. EUR gross total must be positive and below 10,000; all validation, evidence, quality and duplicate checks must pass. AI never approves. Human edits remain manual.\n\nBoth decisions save an immutable snapshot and durable event. The independent 02 workflow and Excel delivery are not connected in this step. Mailpit is local only. No payment, external accounting, mailbox deletion or external notification. Bind the existing readonly Gmail credential after import. This export is inactive for safe import.",
        "width": 2800,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
